# Circle entity-secret recovery files. The only way to reset an entity secret,
# and Circle does not keep a copy — committing one hands over control of every
# developer-controlled wallet.
#
# Anchored to contracts/: an unanchored `recovery/` matches any directory of
# that name, which silently excluded the borrower recovery screen's source.
/contracts/recovery/
*.dat

